<title>UK: TABLE - Revised British PSBR forecasts.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Revised British PSBR forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a table of revised forecasts (in billions of pounds) for Britain's Public Sector Borrowing Requirement (PSBR) announced on Wednesday in budget documents</p>
<p>- - - - -				  1997/8    1998/9</p>
<p>PSBR IN NOVEMBER 1996 BUDGET	 19.2	  12.2</p>
<p>Effects of:</p>
<p>   Changes in assumptions	     0.6	   3.2</p>
<p>   Forecasting changes		 -3.3	  -6.7</p>
<p>Local authority capital</p>
<p>     receipts initiative		0.2	   0.7</p>
<p>   Budget tax changes		  -3.4	  -4.1</p>
<p>  Total changes			  -5.9	  -6.8</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>PSBR in July 1997 budget, excluding</p>
<p>windfall tax and associated spending</p>
<p>						13.3	  5.4</p>
<p>   Effects of windfall tax	    -2.6	 -2.6</p>
<p>   Welfare to work spending	    0.2	  1.2</p>
<p>PSBR in July 1997 budget		10.9	  4.0</p>
</text>
